		<div id="fsPageBodyWrapper" class="fsPageBodyWrapper">
			<div id="fsPageBody" class="fsStyleAutoclear fsPageBody">

				<main id="fsPageContent" class="fsPageContent">
							<h1 class="fsPageTitle">Voter Information</h1>




							<div class="fsPageLayout fsLayout fsOneColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8556" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8557"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8719" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8720"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8558" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8558">Get Out & Vote in the Tuesday, November 3rd General Election!</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>The West Essex Regional School District bond referendum will appear as two questions on the Tuesday, November&nbsp;3<sup>rd</sup> general election ballot.&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>Every vote counts, so your participation is important! </strong></p>

<h4 style="text-align: center;">Make your plan to vote<br>with the information below.</h4>


<p>&nbsp;</p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleOneThird fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8721"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsEmbed" id="fsEl_8868" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		    <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.westex.org/referendum" title="Link takes you to referendum site."><span class="button-large-1">Referendum Website Homepage</span></a></p>

	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsNavigation fsList nav-sub" id="fsEl_8722" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<nav><ul class="fsNavLevel1"><li><a href="/about/referendum/proposed-projects">Proposed Projects</a></li><li><a href="/about/referendum/funding-details">Funding Details</a></li><li><a href="/about/referendum/faqs">Referendum FAQs</a></li><li class="fsNavCurrentPage"><a href="/about/referendum/voter-information">Voter Information</a></li></ul></nav>
	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsContainer callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8658" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8658">What does the ballot look like?</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8667" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8668"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSingleItem" id="fsEl_8669" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="8669" data-source-page-id="1388" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsResource fsResourceTypeImage"><figure><picture><img alt="Sample ballot clipping titled “West Essex Regional School District Bond Issue,” presenting arguments for and against proposals, with Yes/No choices." data-aspect-ratio="1.6088794926004228" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1790135759/westexorg/wuqte7wy1rh5idslxdau/Screenshot2026-09-22at115210PM.png%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1790135759/westexorg/wuqte7wy1rh5idslxdau/Screenshot2026-09-22at115210PM.png%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1790135759/westexorg/wuqte7wy1rh5idslxdau/Screenshot2026-09-22at115210PM.png%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1790135759/westexorg/wuqte7wy1rh5idslxdau/Screenshot2026-09-22at115210PM.png%22,%22width%22:946}]" data-permitted-user="true" data-resource-title="Screenshot2026-09-22at115210PM.png" data-resource-uuid="27b070a6-37e2-4d36-92a7-ad4afad4c703"></picture></figure></article>
	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8670"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_8671" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><strong>Voters will be asked for permission to borrow the full amount in each question (Question 1 is $41,926,384 and Question 2 is $7,493,250). Even though state aid will reduce those amounts, the school district would be named as the debt holder, so voter approval is needed for the full amounts.</strong></p>

<p>Much like a homeowner would finance improvements through a home equity loan, the district would pay for projects by borrowing (through the sale of bonds) and spread those costs over the 20-year life of the loan. If both questions are approved, the amount to be repaid would be offset by $9,283,957 in debt service aid (state aid) and shared by all property owners in Essex Fells, Fairfield, North Caldwell and Roseland.</p>

<p><strong>NOTE:</strong>&nbsp;Depending on what town you live in, you may have to turn over your ballot to find the West Essex Regional School District Bond Issue. Don&#39;t forget to vote on both questions.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-file-name="Nov-3-Sample-Ballots-EF-FF-NC-RL.pdf" data-resource-uuid="7f08091e-6f02-4c3b-b5e4-659eb8cc1ffd" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/7f08091e-6f02-4c3b-b5e4-659eb8cc1ffd" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to a PDF packet of Essex County Sample Ballots for the November 3 general election for the towns of Essex Fells, Fairfield, North Caldwell, and Roseland."><span class="button-large-1">View Full Sample Ballots (EF, FF, NC, &amp; RL)</span></a></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a data-page-name="Proposed Projects" href="/fs/pages/1399" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to a referendum projects page"><span class="button-large-1">Learn More About Projects Included in Each Ballot Question</span></a></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsContainer" id="fsEl_8673" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8673">Check Your Voter Registration Status</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8674" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8675"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_8657" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>Regardless of how you cast your ballot, an up-to-date voter registration is required to vote. <strong>The deadline to register to vote was October 13<sup>th</sup> and has now passed. </strong></p>

<p><strong>Before voting, check your voter registration status in the <a href="https://voter.svrs.nj.gov/registration-check" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to NJ Voter database">state database</a>.</strong> For more, visit the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.essexclerk.com/" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to the Essex County Clerk's website.">Essex County Clerk&#39;s website</a>.</p>


	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8676"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsEmbed" id="fsEl_8672" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		    <style>
.countdown-timer {
  pointer-events: none;
  cursor: default;
}
</style>

<script src="https://cdn.logwork.com/widget/countdown.js"></script>
<a class="countdown-timer" data-background="#dc1f1c" data-date="2026-10-13 23:59" data-digitscolor="#ffffff" data-style="columns" data-timezone="America/New_York" href="https://logwork.com/countdown-timer">Deadline to Register to Vote</a>

	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsContainer" id="fsEl_8560" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8560">3 Ways to Cast Your Vote – Make Your Plan Today</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8937" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8938"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-dark" id="fsEl_8564" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8564">Option 1: Vote In Person on Election Day</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><a class="countdown-timer" data-background="#dc1f1c" data-date="2026-11-03 06:00" data-digitscolor="#ffffff" data-style="columns" data-timezone="America/New_York" href="https://logwork.com/countdown-timer">Election Day: Polls Open</a></p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>Polls will be open on Election Day, <strong>Tuesday, Nov. 3</strong> from&nbsp;<strong>6 a.m. &ndash; 8 p.m.!</strong></p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>Find your polling place <a href="https://voter.svrs.nj.gov/polling-place-search" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to polling location finder.">here</a>.</p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>If you arrive at the polls and are told that your ballot was already mailed to you, <strong>ask for a provisional ballot</strong>. This means your ballot will be considered after all in-person and mailed ballots are double-checked and processed.</p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>Polls close at 8 p.m. If you are in line by 8 p.m., you have the right to vote. <strong>Stay in line</strong>, even if it extends past 8 p.m.</p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>See above for information about the layout of the ballot and ensuring you are registered.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>If you will be out of town on election day, make a plan to vote early or by mail!</em></strong></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8939"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-dark" id="fsEl_8565" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8565">Option 2: Vote By Mail</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><strong>&bull;&nbsp;You can vote by mail in this referendum</strong>. If you have already requested a ballot to be mailed to you, and if your address is the same, Essex County may send you a Vote By Mail ballot automatically before the election. <strong>Ballots were sent out beginning September 19.</strong></p>

<p><strong>&bull;&nbsp;</strong>If you have questions or require assistance, contact the Election Office at <a href="tel:9736214920" target="_blank" title="Calls (973) 621-4920">(973) 621-4920</a> or at <a href="mailto:info@clerk.essexcountynj.org" target="_blank" title="Emails info@clerk.essexcountynj.org">info@clerk.essexcountynj.org</a>.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>&bull;&nbsp;The deadline to&nbsp;request a Vote By Mail ballot has now passed.&nbsp;</strong>If you would still like to cast your vote, please do so on Election Day&nbsp;(Nov. 3).</p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>When you receive your Vote By Mail ballot, fill it out and either:</p>

<p style="margin-left: 40px;"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;Mail it</strong> in with a postmark by Nov. 3</p>

<p style="margin-left: 40px;"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;Drop it</strong>&nbsp;in a secure ballot dropbox by 8 p.m. on Nov. 3 at <a href="https://www.essexclerk.com/News/View/2209/updated-drop-box-locations" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to a list of Essex County Dropbox locations on the Essex Clerk website.">one of the following locations</a>, OR</p>

<p style="margin-left: 40px;"><strong>&bull;&nbsp;Deliver it </strong>in person to the County Clerk&rsquo;s Office by 8 p.m. on Nov. 3&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong>&bull; </strong>See above for information about the layout of the ballot.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>Mail-in ballots cannot be submitted at polling places.&nbsp;</strong></em></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	




	</div>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsContent callout-box-dark" id="fsEl_8678" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8678">Option 3: Vote Early In Person (Concluded)</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>EARLY VOTING HAS NOW CONCLUDED. THANK YOU FOR VOTING!&nbsp; </strong></p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>IF YOU HAVE NOT YET CAST YOUR VOTE, PLEASE DO SO ON ELECTION DAY OR SUBMIT YOUR MAIL IN BALLOT BY 11/3.</strong></p>


	</div>


	</section>
	


	</div>


	</section>
	
	<section class="fsElement fsContainer" id="fsEl_8890" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
