	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div class="fsElement fsContainer callout-box-light color-1" id="fsEl_8893" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<section class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_8891" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h3 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_8891">Live Vote Totals</h3>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p><strong>Now is the time to make your plan to vote with the information above!</strong></p>

<p>Polls close at 8 p.m. sharp on Election Day (Tuesday, November 3<sup>rd</sup>). We look forward to sharing the results of the referendum on this page soon after. We will be updating this page throughout the night and coming days as the votes are reported by the County Clerk&#39;s Office.</p>


	</div>


	</section>
	
