			<td>Bond Proposal Question 1</td>
			<td>&ndash;</td>
			<td>&ndash;</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>Bond Proposal Question 2 (can only pass if Q1 passes)</td>
			<td>&ndash;</td>
			<td>&ndash;</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<p>Source: <a href="https://results.enr.clarityelections.com/NJ/Essex/127486/web.345435/#/summary" target="_blank" title="Link takes you to Essex County Clerk Election Results website.">The Essex County Clerk&#39;s Office &ndash; Election Night Reporting</a></p>


	</div>


